#: f1133fa2cb48482bb726725054ab6817
msgid ""
"3 of the 4 ports provide 3.3V power on **pin1**, while the **/dev/tty-1** "
"provides 5V power (note that **pin6** is not ground, unlike on a Pixhawk). "
"You will need to check whether your GPS can be powered off 3.3V. A uBlox GPS"
" is recommended, although any ArduPilot compatible serial GPS can be used."
msgstr ""
"4 个接口中有 3 个在 **引脚 1** 提供 3.3V 电源，而 **/dev/tty-1** 提供 5V 电源（注意 **引脚 6** "
"不是地线，与 Pixhawk 不同）。您需要确认您的 GPS 是否可以由 3.3V 供电。推荐使用 uBlox GPS，但任何 ArduPilot "
"兼容的串口 GPS 均可使用。"

